{"3489120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Nova", "steam_appid": 3489120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unrestricted Strategic Survival Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe’s resources are finite, but humanity’s ambition is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fall of Earth, power-hungry elites began chasing wealth and immortality, forsaking compassion for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the ruthless balance between despair and hope?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/e1c2a37982c97aa1deec2353e0cd1795.avif?t=1761200460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras_big/e1c2a37982c97aa1deec2353e0cd1795.avif?t=1761200460 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle to Survive Under Oppression, Extraction PvPvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10–20 players fight fiercely to claim the galaxy’s most coveted resource: <strong>Luminite</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must carry what you've gathered to a designated extraction point. Outsmarting, ambushing, and overpowering other survivors along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/26c19bc71a8e96a404374cd6065dba96.avif?t=1761200460\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Melee Combat That Dictates Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Last Nova</i> is close, brutal, and precise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only cold weapons are allowed—no firearms, no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge blades and blunt force tools, master your timing, and use dodges, blocks, and ripostes to control each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike and parry triggers responsive animations and stunning effects, pulling you deeper into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/bf97bdf3f1526a98dc3355cee687ac61.avif?t=1761200460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras_big/bf97bdf3f1526a98dc3355cee687ac61.avif?t=1761200460 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unrestricted Strategic Survival Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe’s resources are finite, but humanity’s ambition is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fall of Earth, power-hungry elites began chasing wealth and immortality, forsaking compassion for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the ruthless balance between despair and hope?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/e1c2a37982c97aa1deec2353e0cd1795.avif?t=1761200460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras_big/e1c2a37982c97aa1deec2353e0cd1795.avif?t=1761200460 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle to Survive Under Oppression, Extraction PvPvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10–20 players fight fiercely to claim the galaxy’s most coveted resource: <strong>Luminite</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must carry what you've gathered to a designated extraction point. Outsmarting, ambushing, and overpowering other survivors along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/26c19bc71a8e96a404374cd6065dba96.avif?t=1761200460\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Melee Combat That Dictates Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Last Nova</i> is close, brutal, and precise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only cold weapons are allowed—no firearms, no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge blades and blunt force tools, master your timing, and use dodges, blocks, and ripostes to control each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike and parry triggers responsive animations and stunning effects, pulling you deeper into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras/bf97bdf3f1526a98dc3355cee687ac61.avif?t=1761200460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/extras_big/bf97bdf3f1526a98dc3355cee687ac61.avif?t=1761200460 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Last Nova is a ruthless extraction-based PvPvE action game. 10–20 players dive into resource-depleted, hazardous zones where only melee, cold weapons are allowed. Fight, strategize, and survive. Only those who reach the final extraction point with what they’ve claimed make it out alive.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/4eb8159f887a827e6f5f2c6e2076bb12d364a23e/header.jpg?t=1761200460", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/8ed69970a01aaa5bdce307367deced3024276123/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761200460", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489120/8ed69970a01aaa5bdce307367deced3024276123/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761200460", "website": "https://last-nova.